    "heightBasis": "Photo-led main log wall3.35m/red hip ridge5.25m; lower annex wall2.6m/ridge3.78m above one level floor. The internal split, annex inset, door dimensions, bracing census and unseen rear remain reconstructed. Retained ground varies only0.23m across the footprint, so no sloped roof/floor adaptation is used. Floor0.2621166822335397m above outside datum and modest exposed plinth approximate native contact; no surveyed historical threshold claim.",
